OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APolice investigating David Walliams
OL,4,Aover reports alleging serious sexual
OL,5,Aoffences
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Metropolitan Police has launched an
OL,8,Finvestigation into David Walliams over
OL,9,Freports of "alleged serious sexual
OL,10,Foffences".
OL,12,FIt comes after ITV News and the
OL,13,FGuardian published reports alleging
OL,14,Fthat Walliams had been accused of
OL,15,Fsexual misconduct by several women.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11912
SC,0012
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1794629899
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APolice investigating David Walliams
OL,4,Aover reports alleging serious sexual
OL,5,Aoffences
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Met said that the allegations being
OL,8,Finvestigated are separate from those
OL,9,Freported by ITV and the Guardian, but
OL,10,Fas "part of their investigation,
OL,11,Fdetectives are also proactively
OL,12,Freviewing that reporting to establish
OL,13,Fwhether there is any evidence of
OL,14,Foffences".
OL,16,FWhen those allegations were first
OL,17,Freported, Walliams said he was "not a
OL,18,Fsexual predator" and had not "broken
OL,19,Fthe law".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/18
